{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tracingdestinations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked."}],"metadata":{"role":"collection","externalID":"TracingDestinations","title":"TracingDestinations","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"TracingDestinations"}]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Destinations","anchor":"Destinations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination","type":"reference"},{"text":" finds each record’s span from the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"text":" the event was tracked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in, so a delivery that runs later, under another span or none, still adds the event to the right","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one. Each span event is named after the event, stamped with the time it was tracked, and carries","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the event’s description under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"text":" and its call site under OpenTelemetry’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"text":" attribute","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Span events can’t be added to a span that has ended. A record tracked outside any span, or whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"span ended before its batch was delivered, is left out. Batch tightly enough for your spans to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outlive their batches, and deliver to another destination as well for the events that must not be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lost. To write events to your logs instead, use ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggerDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggingDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"module.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: SpanEventDestination(tracer: tracer))","let span = tracer.startSpan(\"checkout\")","ServiceContext.withValue(span.context) {","    tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()","span.end()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The umbrella guide on this area is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations/SpanEventDestination":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations\/spaneventdestination","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each event to the span that was active when the event was tracked."}],"title":"SpanEventDestination","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpanEventDestination"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpanEventDestination"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"TracingDestinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations","role":"collection"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","title":"Choosing Destinations","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Choosing Destinations","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations"}}}